# DataOps Infrastructure Validation Plan
**Author:** Catalyst (Nova #95)
**Date:** April 17, 2025
**Version:** 1.0

## Overview

This validation plan defines a comprehensive approach to verify that all 29 components outlined in the MASTER_DATAOPS_DEPLOYMENT plan have been successfully deployed and are fully operational across the 4-server DataOps infrastructure.

## 1. Server Infrastructure Validation

### 1.1 Physical Server Verification
- [ ] 1.1.1 Verify Primary Server (10.240.8.5) is accessible via SSH
- [ ] 1.1.2 Verify Vector Server (10.240.1.7) is accessible via SSH
- [ ] 1.1.3 Verify TimeSeries Server (10.240.1.9) is accessible via SSH
- [ ] 1.1.4 Verify GPU Server (10.240.1.11) is accessible via SSH
- [ ] 1.1.5 Confirm server specifications match plan requirements
  - [ ] 1.1.5.1 Primary Server: bx2-8x32
  - [ ] 1.1.5.2 Vector Server: bx2-8x32
  - [ ] 1.1.5.3 TimeSeries Server: bx2-8x32
  - [ ] 1.1.5.4 GPU Server: gx3-48x240x2l40s with NVIDIA GPUs

### 1.2 Storage Verification
- [ ] 1.2.1 Verify Data Disk (100GB) is properly mounted at `/data` on all servers
- [ ] 1.2.2 Verify Logs Disk (50GB) is properly mounted at `/logs` on all servers
- [ ] 1.2.3 Validate directory structure follows specifications in MASTER_DATAOPS_DEPLOYMENT.clineplan

### 1.3 Network Verification
- [ ] 1.3.1 Test connectivity between all server pairs using ping
- [ ] 1.3.2 Verify DNS resolution between servers
- [ ] 1.3.3 Confirm firewall rules allow proper communication for all required ports
- [ ] 1.3.4 Test SSH key-based authentication between servers

